WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.221
Open Memorization for your class and choose Add memorization.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.973
Name the verse, prayer, or hymn. Add instructions and an optional date.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.893
Select Add memorization. Check that your assignment appears.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.437
Enter each child’s score as a whole number from zero to one hundred.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.697
Add a brief note if helpful. Leave unassessed children’s scores blank.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.756
Choose Save scores and wait for the confirmation.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.931
Check the scored count and average. You can return to this memorization later.
